# Maintainer: misc-de <misc-de@users.noreply.github.com>

# The voices of plinius-speech: Piper 1.5 voices (rhasspy/piper-voices on Hugging Face, retrained
# in November 2026 on bases of free data: rdh, CC0, or hifi_tts_92, Hi-Fi TTS, CC BY 4.0), one
# package per voice, medium quality, about 63 MB each. Only voices whose data and base are freely
# usable: the older versions (also the converted archives of sherpa-onnx) are fine-tuned from
# lessac (research only) or ryan (non-commercial). Each package ships the voice's MODEL_CARD,
# which names its data and base: the attribution CC BY asks for.
# The list of all voices for GNOME Settings is plinius-speech's voices.json: keep both together.
pkgbase=plinius-speech-voices
